  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12i_isReferredToEntity">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of R12 has referred to entity: in DeSMòS, it relates a hypotextual entity (expression or passage) to the intertextual relation in which it is the entity referred to. The original property has domain the union of lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature and intro:INT6_Architext and range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression or intro:INT21_TextPassage and range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di R12 has referred to entity: in DeSMòS collega un'entità ipotestuale (espressione o passaggio) alla relazione intertestuale in cui è l'entità a cui si fa riferimento. La proprietà originale ha come domain l'unione di lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature e intro:INT6_Architext e come range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression o intro:INT21_TextPassage e come range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R12i è entità a cui si riferisce di</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R12i is referred to entity of</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:nodeID="N519b097bffb94882b572110f47d6b1ce"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N8d32349f039c4883a38925ad3d548524">
